== Notes ==
* The area of effect is large; the spell description incorrectly lists it as colossal.
* The in-game description of this spell erroneously reports that it is affected by spell resistance; ''lesser dispel'' does not check spell resistance.
* The in-game description incorrectly reports the innate level of this spell as 1.
* If used as an area of effect, this spell will also attempt to dispel any area of effect spells centered in affected area.
* Most of the spells of a [[class level|level]] 15 caster are immune to ''lesser dispel'', as the dispeller's best possible roll is 25 (20+5), while the DC is 26 (11+15). The exceptions involve vagaries in determining the effective caster level; see [[dispel]] for details.

=== Previous versions ===
* Prior to version 1.69, this spell could not be [[still spell|stilled]].
*Prior to NWN EE 1.74, an effect's caster's level had been added to 12, not 11, to get the dispel DC, even though the in-game text has always claimed "11". This meant that the spells of a caster with a level as low as 14 were immune to this spell.

